  BeforeCombatTransitionText: 
  AfterCombatTransitionText: Fine then. That I go out with a whimper is my shame.
    But what is it that you expect out there? Freedom? No. Virulent banality is all
    that you will find. Just a different cage, and one far less captivating. So go,
    I won't follow. From plain view I say "I'm finished." "Okay" responds the protagonist.
